       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. LONGCMT1.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-MONTO PIC 9(7)V99.
       01 WS-LIMITE PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 1000.
      *THIS COMMENT LINE IS INTENTIONALLY LONGER THAN EIGHTY COLUMNS TO PROVE LINE LENGTH ALONE IS NEVER A REJECTION CRITERION WHEN THE LINE IS A COMMENT THAT GETS IGNORED BY THE STRUCTURAL AUTO DETECTION LOGIC.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           IF WS-MONTO > WS-LIMITE
               MOVE 1 TO WS-MONTO
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-MONTO
           END-IF.
           GOBACK.
